{
  "version": 1,
  "label": "Period Portrait",
  "type": [
    "human"
  ],
  "description": "One person, one period, everything agreeing. The variant picks the era and every era slot follows it — clothes, hair, the room and the film stock all land in the same decade instead of borrowing from four. Leave the variant on random and each render moves through time.",
